---
description: Project writing voice
alwaysApply: true
---

Write in this project's voice. Open with the goal, then the how. Follow any abstract claim with a concrete case. Prefer numbers to adjectives. Do not use corporate filler, stock assistant phrasing, or this-matters / not-X-but-Y frames. Load the writing-voice skill for registers and the avoid list. Use a spaced en dash, not an em dash.
